  "methodology_notes": [
    "Six fixed synthetic documents and three Chinese/English queries were recreated because MODEL_RECOMMENDATIONS.md does not retain the original full fixtures; scores are not an exact replay of the prior benchmark.",
    "The initial cross-batch vector absolute-difference threshold was too strict. Controlled same-batch prefix comparisons were exactly equal; cross-batch cosine similarity was at least 0.9999975. The verifier now compares vector directions.",
    "The initial 17-input check established output completeness only. Additional schema and runtime checks established that the saved batch size 16 is ineffective; the verifier now checks both completeness and effective batch size.",
    "JSON schema passed via JSON mode plus a schema prompt, not native strict schema enforcement.",
    "Tool calls were inspected without executing an external tool. No user business documents were used.",
    "No full 262K/32K context, 16384-token output, long-document batch, concurrency, or production business-accuracy testing was performed."
  ],
